{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-40b2e9e97868","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-40b2e9e97868","name":"鸡蛋三明治","category":"breakfast","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/breakfast/%E9%B8%A1%E8%9B%8B%E4%B8%89%E6%98%8E%E6%B2%BB.md","blob_sha":"0f425955a2593ab87584bb98751434d3bec1fd44","details":{"introduction":"这是一道简单快手的西式简餐，吐司夹着绵密的鸡蛋酱和咸香培根，口感软嫩又带着焦香。鸡蛋富含优质蛋白，搭配培根和黄油能快速补充能量。操作非常友好，厨房新手也能轻松驾驭，全程只需 大约 10 分钟即可完成。","difficulty":"★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 鸡蛋\n- 吐司\n- 培根\n- 黄油\n- 蛋黄酱\n- 盐\n- 黑胡椒"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"- 鸡蛋 1 个\n- 吐司 2 片\n- 培根 2 片\n- 黄油 10 g\n- 蛋黄酱 20g\n- 盐 1g\n- 黑胡椒 2g"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 吐司切去四边，备用\n2. 鸡蛋煮熟，捣碎\n3. 混合鸡蛋、蛋黄酱、盐、黑胡椒\n4. 锅中加入黄油，煎熟培根\n5. 组装吐司，在两片吐司间加入制作好的鸡蛋酱及培根\n6. 四边形吐司切成三角形装盘"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"- 也可加入芝士、酸黄瓜等食材"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：去壳全熟鸡蛋100g、白吐司200g、培根50g、无盐黄油15g、普通蛋黄酱35g、食盐1g、黑胡椒粉2g；整份约450g。全熟去壳鸡蛋、白吐司和通用蛋黄酱，培根煸出油全部食用；不含可选配料。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":274.237778,"protein_g":8.400333,"carbohydrate_g":22.535222,"fat_g":16.4956},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173424/nutrients","version":"a6099f2ed5f68bc6","fdc_ids":[173424,174924,168277,173430,171009,173468,170931]},"profile_id":"family-40b2e9e97868-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-40b2e9e97868","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-40b2e9e97868","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"pan_fry","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-40b2e9e97868-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"egg_boiled","grams":100},{"key":"bread","grams":200},{"key":"bacon","grams":50},{"